  "observations": [
    "The two configuration escapes leave the package below FSEL/MODE; the back FSEL elbow clears the separate MODE ground via.",
    "R200 and R206 connect through a separate feedback-trim via without moving either resistor.",
    "The dedicated In2 output-sense path runs to the left of the inductor and switch/boot region, then turns below the cell to R200.",
    "The In1 trace joins the configuration grounds to the quiet ground via beside the BP5 ground pad. It is not a completed PGND/reference plane.",
    "Existing U23 local planes remain unchanged; U20 sense-reference plane coverage and quiet-to-PGND connection remain incomplete.",
    "Input bulk and enable routing remain open; whole-board views do not establish fabrication readiness or full installed fit."
  ],
